## SUBJECT LINE PRINCIPLES

**Good subject lines:**
- ✅ Include their name or agency: "University Health — Pharmacy Courier Capability"
- ✅ Reference their problem: "Reducing NEMT no-shows by 40%"
- ✅ Create urgency: "Following up — Bid due Monday"
- ✅ Ask a question: "Quick question about RFP-226-03-068"

**Bad subject lines:**
- ❌ Generic: "Introduction" / "Inquiry" / "Services"
- ❌ About you: "Dee Davis Inc Capabilities"
- ❌ Too long: "RE: FW: RE: Following up on our previous conversation about..."
- ❌ All caps or spammy: "URGENT OPPORTUNITY!!!"

---

## FIRST SENTENCE RULES

**Kill these openers:**
- ❌ "I hope this email finds you well"
- ❌ "I wanted to reach out to introduce myself"
- ❌ "I am writing to inquire about"
- ❌ "My name is Dee Davis and I own..."

**Use these instead:**
- ✅ Lead with THEIR problem: "Managing 7,900 pharmacy deliveries monthly requires..."
- ✅ Lead with value: "We reduced NEMT costs by 23% for a similar health system."
- ✅ Lead with the point: "Following up on the Lab Courier RFP — one quick question."
- ✅ Lead with connection: "Jeff Metz suggested I reach out regarding..."

---

## 🚨 NEVER NAME CONTRACTORS/PARTNERS TO PROSPECTS — EVER

**This is NON-NEGOTIABLE.**

In ANY email to a prospect, buyer, CO, or MCO contact:

- ❌ **NEVER** name fulfillment partners (Uber Health, Quest, Labcorp, etc.)
- ❌ **NEVER** name subcontractors
- ❌ **NEVER** name platform providers
- ❌ **NEVER** name driver networks or courier services

**Why:** If you tell them "we use [Partner X]," they will contact that partner directly and cut DDI out. Protect your business.

**What to say instead:**
- ✅ "DDI's credentialed courier network"
- ✅ "Our nationwide fulfillment infrastructure"
- ✅ "HIPAA-compliant delivery partners under DDI contract management"
- ✅ "Our vetted driver network with background checks and BAA coverage"

**The prospect doesn't need to know WHO fulfills — they need to know DDI DELIVERS.**

---

## THE "WHY DDI" SENTENCE

Every buyer email should include ONE memorable differentiator:

**Template:** "DDI [specific capability] + [proof point]."

**Examples (NO partner names):**
- ✅ "DDI delivers 7,900+ monthly Rx shipments through our nationwide courier network — zero fleet overhead, 99.2% on-time."
- ✅ "As an EDWOSB, DDI provides the same testing services as national labs but with direct access to ownership and faster issue resolution."
- ✅ "DDI manages NEMT for 187,000+ Medicaid members in Michigan — same model, same platform, ready for Texas."

**NEVER:**
- ❌ "We partner with Uber Health for deliveries" — **THEY WILL CALL UBER DIRECTLY**
- ❌ "Quest Diagnostics processes our labs" — **THEY WILL CALL QUEST DIRECTLY**
- ❌ "We use ScriptDrop for pharmacy courier" — **THEY WILL CALL SCRIPTDROP DIRECTLY**
- ❌ "DDI is committed to quality service." (generic, forgettable)
- ❌ "We have years of experience." (vague, no proof)

