## FOLLOW-UP CADENCE

**If no response:**

| Day | Action |
|-----|--------|
| Day 0 | Send initial email |
| Day 3 | Reply to same thread: "Floating this back up — [restate ask]" |
| Day 7 | New email, new angle: Add value (article, insight, offer) |
| Day 14 | Final attempt: "Last follow-up — here if you need [service]" |
| Day 21+ | Move to quarterly touchpoint list |

**Rule:** Never more than 4 emails without response. After 4, they're not interested right now — stay on radar quarterly.

