## INTEGRATION WITH WIN ENGINE

**Email is part of the win strategy:**

| Win Factor | How Email Helps |
|------------|-----------------|
| Know the buyer | Smart questions in email show you did homework |
| Build relationship | Value-first emails create goodwill |
| Stay on radar | Follow-up cadence keeps DDI top of mind |
| Differentiator | Every email reinforces the "why DDI" message |
| Champion inside | Emails help identify and cultivate internal advocates |

**Before major emails (CO outreach, MCO intro, follow-up on big opportunity):**
- Review Win Position Scorecard
- Identify which gap this email is trying to close
- Craft email specifically to close that gap

